      { question: "Do I need to have a specific field of study for the Rhodes Scholarship?", answer: "No. Rhodes Scholars study across all disciplines including sciences, humanities, law, medicine, and public policy. The scholarship is field-agnostic." },
      { question: "Can I apply for the Rhodes Scholarship more than once?", answer: "Yes. Many successful scholars applied multiple times. Rejection in one year does not bar you from reapplying the following year." }
