      { question: "What is the Genuine Temporary Entrant requirement?", answer: "GTE requires you to prove that your intent to study in Australia is genuine and temporary. Immigration officers assess your ties to home country, study history, and career plans. Students who appear to be seeking immigration through the student visa pathway (rather than genuine education) are refused." }
