      { question: "How do international students find jobs abroad after graduation?", answer: "Through a combination of: internships during study, career services at your university, LinkedIn networking, alumni connections, campus recruitment events, and proactive applications. Start building your professional network from your first week." },
      { question: "Is LinkedIn effective for students?", answer: "Yes, significantly so. Studies consistently show that professional connections (even weak ties from brief meetings) are more predictive of job outcomes than academic grades alone. Build your LinkedIn network consistently throughout your degree." }
